---
// Chapter 2, "separate visual hierarchy from document hierarchy": the same settings section.
// Left: styled like the tags (h1 huge, h2 large), so titles take the attention.
// Right: same tags, titles small and quiet like labels, so the content leads.

const W = 900;
const H = 330;
const panels = [
  { x: 20, good: false },
  { x: 470, good: true },
];
---
<figure class="tns">
  <div class="tns-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two versions of an account settings page with the same h1 and h2 tags. Left: a huge Manage account title and large section titles, with small content. Right: the titles are small and grey, and the email address and plan name are the largest text.">
      {panels.map((p) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={p.x} y="14" width="410" height="250" rx="8" class="tns-frame" />
          <text x={p.x + 24} y={p.good ? 50 : 66} class="tns-tag">h1</text>
          <text x={p.x + 52} y={p.good ? 50 : 66} class:list={['tns-h1', { 'is-quiet': p.good }]}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>Manage account</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>Quản lý tài khoản</tspan>
          </text>

          <text x={p.x + 24} y={p.good ? 92 : 112} class="tns-tag">h2</text>
          <text x={p.x + 52} y={p.good ? 92 : 112} class:list={['tns-h2', { 'is-quiet': p.good }]}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>Email address</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>Địa chỉ email</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={p.x + 52} y={p.good ? 120 : 136} class:list={['tns-value', { 'is-lead': p.good }]}>linh@example.com</text>

          <text x={p.x + 24} y={p.good ? 172 : 184} class="tns-tag">h2</text>
          <text x={p.x + 52} y={p.good ? 172 : 184} class:list={['tns-h2', { 'is-quiet': p.good }]}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>Plan</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>Gói dịch vụ</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={p.x + 52} y={p.good ? 200 : 208} class:list={['tns-value', { 'is-lead': p.good }]}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>Pro, renews 1 Dec</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>Pro, gia hạn 1/12</tspan>
          </text>

          <text x={p.x} y="292" class:list={['tns-label', { 'is-good': p.good }]}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>{p.good ? 'Same tags, styled for importance' : 'Styled like the tags: titles shout'}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{p.good ? 'Cùng thẻ, tạo kiểu theo mức quan trọng' : 'Tạo kiểu theo thẻ: tiêu đề la to'}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={p.x} y="314" class="tns-note">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{p.good ? 'The email and the plan are what people came to see' : 'The values you came for are the smallest text'}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{p.good ? 'Email và gói dịch vụ mới là thứ người dùng cần xem' : 'Giá trị cần xem lại là chữ nhỏ nhất'}</tspan>
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The small grey h1, h2 marks show the markup, which is identical in both. Only the styling changed.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các nhãn h1, h2 nhỏ màu xám cho biết markup, ở hai bên giống hệt nhau. Chỉ có cách tạo kiểu thay đổi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .tns { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .tns-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .tns svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 680px; height: auto; }
  .tns text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .tns-frame { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .tns text.tns-tag { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-faint); font-weight: 600; }
  .tns text.tns-h1 { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .tns text.tns-h1.is-quiet { font-size: 18px; }
  .tns text.tns-h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .tns text.tns-h2.is-quiet { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .tns text.tns-value { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .tns text.tns-value.is-lead { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .tns text.tns-label { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .tns text.tns-label.is-good { fill: var(--red); }
  .tns text.tns-note { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .tns figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
